  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "This 4-koma manga follows the story of Liz, an elementary school foreign transfer student. She comes from an unnamed northern land and speaks Japanese, English, Russian, and her native language. In school, she quickly makes friends with two other girls, Hinoki and Kurosugi. Both her new Japanese friends are mischievous schemers. Hinoki's tricks tend to be obvious and simple, while Kurosugi is smarter and more subtle. The three of them enjoy their daily school life together!"
  },
